docs {
  Replaces the access groups that open a whole space group (#1422, ADR 0041): the same links as "Access groups - Set space groups", seen from the space group. An empty list removes every link. Owner, admins, moderators with the manage spaces right. A cuid of another community gives a 400. Token ability: groups:write.
}
